      "diff": "@@ -41,6 +41,7 @@ Slide files use the following structure:\n               }\n           },\n           \"types\": {\n+              \"seasonal\": { \"randomized\": false, \"maxdisplay\": 0 },\n               \"events\": { \"randomized\": false, \"maxdisplay\": 0, \"only\": false },\n               \"sponsorship\": { \"randomized\": false, \"maxdisplay\": 0 },\n               \"tips\": { \"randomized\": true, \"maxdisplay\": 3, \"only\": false }\n@@ -135,12 +136,11 @@ Per-slide fields:\n                   \"seasonal\" are reserved for the predefined slides.json\n                   and cannot be used in custom slide files.\n   title           Required. Main heading text.\n-  description     Required. Primary text shown in the highlight box.\n-  url             Required. Target URL opened when the slide or button\n-                  is clicked.\n+  description     Required(*). Primary text shown in the highlight box.\n+  url             Required. Target URL opened when the button is clicked.\n   tag             Optional. Short label shown as a pill/badge above the\n                   title (e.g. \"Conference\", \"Tip of the Day\").\n-  description_sub Optional. Secondary line in the highlight box.\n+  description_sub Optional(*). Secondary line in the highlight box.\n   body_text       Optional. Additional paragraph below the highlight box.\n                   Only visible in non-compact mode.\n   button_label    Optional. Text for the action button.\n@@ -159,11 +159,14 @@ Per-slide fields:\n   date_day        Optional. Integer (1-31). For seasonal slides: the\n                   day of month when the slide should be shown.\n \n-Slides missing any required field (type, title, description, url) are\n+Slides missing any required field (type, title, description(*), url) are\n skipped with a warning. Omitted optional fields default to empty strings\n (or no date constraint for date_from/date_until). Slides without date\n fields are always visible.\n \n+(*) Seasonal slides show no description or description_sub. The required\n+description field can be assigned an empty string.\n+\n Slide strings are intentionally not translatable. Content changes\n frequently and translation lag would be worse than untranslated text.\n \n",
